Class cSigCjComITabManagerMargin is a Mixin

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComLeft Returns Integer
        Integer retVal
        Get ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 1 OLE_VT_I4 to retVal
        Function_Return retVal
    End_Function

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Procedure Set ComLeft Integer value
        Set ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 1 OLE_VT_I4 to value
    End_Procedure

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComTop Returns Integer
        Integer retVal
        Get ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 2 OLE_VT_I4 to retVal
        Function_Return retVal
    End_Function

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Procedure Set ComTop Integer value
        Set ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 2 OLE_VT_I4 to value
    End_Procedure

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComRight Returns Integer
        Integer retVal
        Get ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 3 OLE_VT_I4 to retVal
        Function_Return retVal
    End_Function

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Procedure Set ComRight Integer value
        Set ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 3 OLE_VT_I4 to value
    End_Procedure

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComBottom Returns Integer
        Integer retVal
        Get ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 4 OLE_VT_I4 to retVal
        Function_Return retVal
    End_Function

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Procedure Set ComBottom Integer value
        Set ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 4 OLE_VT_I4 to value
    End_Procedure

    Procedure ComSetRect Integer llLeft Integer llTop Integer llRight Integer llBottom
        Handle hDispatchDriver
        Get phDispatchDriver to hDispatchDriver
        Send PrepareParams to hDispatchDriver 4
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llLeft
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llTop
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llRight
        Send DefineParam to hDispatchDriver OLE_VT_I4 llBottom
        Send InvokeComMethod to hDispatchDriver 5 OLE_VT_VOID
    End_Procedure
End_Class

Class cSigCjComTabManagerMargin is a cComAutomationObject
    Import_Class_Protocol cSigCjComITabManagerMargin

    Procedure Construct_Object
        Forward Send Construct_Object
        Set peAutoCreate to acNoAutoCreate
    End_Procedure
End_Class

